   "isHistorical": false,
   "sid": "sc-jianyan1-1127-shaosong",
   "officialTitle": "塔塔儿·别乞（萨满）",
   "role": "塔塔儿萨满",
   "age": 53,
   "stance": "塔塔儿大萨满·通腾格里·卜战占祸福",
